  "details": "I see a couple of other requests for similar \"topic-based worlds\" but I don't think it should be limited to worlds. I generally like to be able to gather/discuss things with people with like-minded interests.\n\nEntering a world and asking each person if they program in Udon is an inefficient way to locate people.\n\nIf people want to discuss cool avatars (and little else) or Star Trek (for instance) giving them a way to indicate it would be useful for everyone.",
